 "notes": "Volume holds the Tribunal Calificador's definitive scrutiny tables and proclamations for the five provincial groupings that elected senators in 1937 (1a, 3a, 5a, 7a, 9a; 5 seats each); p. 2 lists all nine groupings of the 1937-1941 period. No registered, cast or national totals are printed. Grouping totals are the 'Total General' columns; several grouping valid totals exist only as handwritten pencil sums, recorded and flagged in each contest's notes. Lists printed as 'Retirada' (withdrawn) with no votes are omitted. Party labels are the list descriptions as printed; candidates' party affiliations are printed only in the proclamations and are not recorded."
